  "@type": "SemioticProjection",
  "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
  "label": "User projected onto the woman in the kitchen scene",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the woman (VisualMaterial entity) in the image, as the meme uses the phrase 'when your dishwasher is ready for another load' to imply the user is the one who experiences this situation — specifically, the user is the one who must load the dishwasher, and the woman's body is humorously framed as 'ready' for another load. The deictic 'your' in the text directly projects the user's perspective onto the scene, making the viewer identify with the person who must deal with the dishwasher and, by extension, the woman's physical presence in the kitchen. The projection is onto the VisualMaterial entity 'woman' and the Scene entity 'kitchen_domestic_task', as the user is invited to imagine themselves in the context of the domestic task and the objectified portrayal of the woman.",
  "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface",
